name: roaming_rejected_settlements
description: "DEMO 1b — Revenue leakage: the same partner graph narrowed by a saved predicate to REJECTED settlements. Kestrel Telecom's TAP files are rejected ~40% of the time; the predicate travels with the view (two-stage loop: Apply locally is free, Push to server re-projects the Dataset once the backend accepts the filter). Then switch to the IMSI view for the impossible traveller (001010000000042 on four visited networks in three days)."
sourceId: entity-projection
layout: force
profile: telecom
query:
  projection:
    datasetId: roaming_tap_dataset
    sourceCol: SENDER_NAME
    targetCol: RECIPIENT_NAME
    linkKindCol: EVENT_TYPE
    attrCols[3]: EVENT_AT,CHARGE_SDR,SETTLEMENT_STATUS
  filter:
    kind: group
    op: AND
    items[1]{kind,field,operator,value}:
      condition,SETTLEMENT_STATUS,"=",REJECTED
view:
  legend: true
  workingSet: true
  plugins:
    minimap: true
    hulls: true
    behaviors[1]: hover-activate
